<mujoco model="arm">
  <!-- Spot arm with the original mesh collision geoms.
  Composed into a Spot model with <attach>; the mount transform lives in the
  parent's <frame>, not here. meshdir is relative to this file.
  The materials (BlackAbs, wrap) are deliberately not declared here: they are
  global names, so a second copy would collide on attach, and the parent stays
  the single place to restyle them. So this file only loads attached to Spot. -->
